WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.880
A handoff is two moves: the status in EVO, and the post in Slack.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:11.008
In EVO, the line item status is the truth. When the work moves, update the status.

00:00:11.008 --> 00:00:18.288
Need design? Post in sd-design-needed. Order number first, then the specs, and the client file attached.

00:00:18.288 --> 00:00:26.576
Ready to print? One line in sd-production: the order number, the customer, ready to print, and the EVO link.

00:00:26.576 --> 00:00:32.728
Installed and done? Post the photos in sd-completed, and tag Yida to close the loop.

00:00:32.728 --> 00:00:38.448
EVO holds the job. Slack holds the talk. The order number ties them together.
